	(text "BRAKE DETECTION (this module, not hand controller):\nV_BLACK < 500mV  => enter brake state\nV_BLACK > 1500mV => exit brake state\nHysteresis band prevents chatter at low throttle settings."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 140 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "42a94a7f-4d17-4483-88d8-18e800733a98")
	)
	(text "ALL CONNECTORS: 4mm banana sockets"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 42.926 92.202 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4308638d-b816-498e-8e57-7de5fb5ee64b")
	)
	(text "Track side (J1/J3/J5) connects to the three track banana sockets.\nController side (J2/J4/J6) the hand controller plugs into.\nModule is inserted between track and controller.\nDuring normal running the module is fully transparent.\nBrake detection by voltage sense on BLACK (J3/J4) terminal."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 100 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "614dd4dd-dd55-4533-8248-b5953df4a428")
	)
	(text "LATVIAN BRAKE (track call / emergency stop):\nMonitors WHITE dV/dt each 1ms tick.\nIf WHITE drops faster than SET LATVIAN_DVDT threshold,\nfires immediate dead short regardless of mode or pot.\nDefault: disabled (SET LATVIAN_DVDT 0).\nRecommended: SET LATVIAN_DVDT 1000 (1V/ms)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 158 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b22cd38d-6038-48e5-a221-6c3d1bd21a91")
	)
	(text "SIGNAL DESCRIPTIONS:\nWHITE (+12-16V):  Always-live rail from track PSU (40-90A capable)\n                  Powers module MCU via LDO on power supply sheet.\nBLACK (track +):  Controlled by hand controller (0 to rail voltage).\n                  Falls to near 0V when controller shorts for braking.\n                  Module monitors dV/dt for Latvian brake feature.\nRED (common -):   Left-hand braid return. Common ground reference."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 115 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "c62e5433-2424-4201-b30d-a3b01318f3e9")
	)
